</div></div><a href="#" class="closebtn">×</a></div></div></nav><div class="site-inner"><div class="content-sidebar-wrap"><main class="content"><nav id="breadcrumbs" aria-label="breadcrumbs"><span><span><a href="https://cookingorgeous.com/">Cooking Gorgeous</a></span> » <span><a href="https://cookingorgeous.com/recipes/">Recipes</a></span> » <span><a href="https://cookingorgeous.com/blog/category/main-dishes/">Main Dishes</a></span></span></nav><article class="post-8670 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-main-dishes category-savory-pastries-and-breads category-traditional-turkish-dishes entry grow-content-body" aria-label="Turkish Lahmacun"><header class="entry-header"><h1 class="entry-title">Turkish Lahmacun</h1>
<p class="entry-meta">Published: <time class="entry-time">Nov 1, 2021</time> · Modified: <time class="entry-modified-time">Jan 15, 2026</time> by <span class="entry-author"><a href="https://cookingorgeous.com/about/" class="entry-author-link" rel="author"><span class="entry-author-name">Ayla Clulee</span></a></span> 																																										</p></header><div class="entry-content"><div class="wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-snippet wprm-recipe-template-jump-link-only"><a href="#recipe" data-recipe="8672" style="color: #333333;" class="wprm-recipe-jump wprm-recipe-link wprm-jump-to-recipe-shortcode wprm-block-text-normal">Jump to Recipe</a></div>
<p>Homemade <strong>Turkish Lahmacun (or Lahmajun-Lahmajoun) </strong>is a super-thin, crispy flatbread topped with ground beef or lamb mixed with vegetables, herbs, and spices.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" src="https://cookingorgeous.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/homemade-turkish-lahmacun-recipe-24.jpg" alt="homemade Turkish lahmacun served with tomato slices and parsley" data-skip-lazy class="wp-image-22555" srcset="https://cookingorgeous.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/homemade-turkish-lahmacun-recipe-24.jpg 1200w, https://cookingorgeous.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/homemade-turkish-lahmacun-recipe-24-300x200.jpg 300w, https://cookingorgeous.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/homemade-turkish-lahmacun-recipe-24-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://cookingorgeous.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/homemade-turkish-lahmacun-recipe-24-768x512.jpg 768w, https://cookingorgeous.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/homemade-turkish-lahmacun-recipe-24-150x100.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></figure>



<p>You can find this popular street / fast food everywhere in Turkey, in restaurants, cafes, and fast-food shops. </p>


<style>#feast-advanced-jump-to {
	z-index: 999;
	border: none;
