<h2 id="turkish-lahmacun"   class="wprm-recipe-name wprm-block-text-bold">Turkish Lahmacun</h2>
<div class="wprm-spacer"></div>
<span class="wprm-recipe-details wprm-recipe-author wprm-block-text-light"><a href="https://cookingorgeous.com/about/" target="_self">Ayla Clulee</a></span>
<div class="wprm-spacer"></div>
<div class="wprm-recipe-summary wprm-block-text-normal"><span style="display: block;">Homemade <strong>Turkish Lahmacun (or Lahmajun-Lahmajoun) </strong>is a super-thin crispy flatbread topped with minced beef or lamb mixed with vegetables, herbs, and spices. </span></div>
