<p class="has-text-align-left">Welcome to Cooking Gorgeous, where delicious easy-to-follow recipes and culinary inspiration await you! My name is Ayla Clulee, a passionate and professional Cordon Bleu-trained chef, recipe developer, and food content creator with decades of experience.  I am based in the UK, and I'm thrilled to have you here.</p>



<p>The kitchen is my happy place and cooking is my therapy. </p>



